-bags-2026.webp 1080w, https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1200,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-rubbish-rangers-camp-ii-poop-bags-2026.webp 1200w, https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-rubbish-rangers-camp-ii-poop-bags-2026.webp 1920w" src="https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-rubbish-rangers-camp-ii-poop-bags-2026.webp"/></a><div class="pad"><p class="kicker"><span class="cat">Permits &amp; Rules</span></p><h3><a href="/everest-rubbish-rangers-camp-ii-poop-bags-2026">Nepal Now Stations Rangers at 6,400 Metres on Everest to Weigh Climbers&#x27; Rubbish, Poop Bags Included</a></h3><p>Everest&#x27;s first mountain rangers weighed 9.5 tonnes of waste this spring, and 1.76 tonnes of it was human waste carried down in bags.</p><div class="meta"><time dateTime="2026-09-21T08:48:51.764+00:00">Sep 21, 2026</time><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span><a href="/news/author/laxman-rawal">Laxman Rawal</a></div></div></article></div></div><div class="nv-related"><h2>Latest from the desk</h2><div class="nv-grid"><article class="nv-card" data-cat="climate-environment"><a class="img" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="position:relative" href="/nepal-pm-un-climate-reparations-flood-2026-09"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent;background-size:cover;background-position:50% 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27; %3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;b&#x27; color-interpolation-filters=&#x27;sRGB&#x27;%3E%3CfeGaussianBlur stdDeviation=&#x27;20&#x27;/%3E%3CfeColo