:[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"breaking breaking-dot\",\"children\":\"Breaking\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"cat\",\"children\":\"Safety \u0026 Advisories\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"href\":\"/sauk-mountain-two-hikers-dead-switchback-trail-2026-09\",\"children\":\"Sauk Mountain Just Killed Two Hikers in Three Days, and This Isn't the First Time\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"A 78-year-old and a 66-year-old died three days apart on Washington's Sauk Mountain trail, which has now killed at least five hikers since 2017.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"meta\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-09-27T13:00:03.665+00:00\",\"children\":\"4d ago\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"sep\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"href\":\"/news/author/laxman-rawal\",\"children\":\"Laxman Rawal\"}]]}]]}]]}],false]}]\n78:Taec,\u003cdiv class='nv-keyfacts'\u003e\u003cp class='lbl'\u003eKey facts\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eOfficial height since 2020: \u003cstrong\u003e8,848.86m\u003c/strong\u003e (29,031.7 ft)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePrevious global-standard height: \u003cstrong\u003e8,848m\u003c/strong\u003e, fixed by the Survey of India in 1955\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eChina's earlier rock-only survey (2005): \u003cstrong\u003e8,844.43m\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHeight gained from the old 1955 benchmark: \u003cstrong\u003e0.86m\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNepal's own survey team reached the summit in \u003cstrong\u003eMay 2019\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026mdash; its first solo measurement of its own mountain\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy two countries got two different answers\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe gap was never really about the mountain growing overnight, though it does grow, slowly. It was about what counted as the top. China's 2005 figure measured bare rock, stripping out the snow and ice cap that every climber actually stands on. Nepal, and most of the rest of the world, measured the highest point a person can physically reach, ice included. That single difference in definition created a 4.4-metre disagreement that ran for a decade and a half, printed differently in atlases depending on which side of the border published them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure class=\"nv-figure\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1080,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-official-height-1955-to-2020-2026-s1.webp\" srcset=\"https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=74,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-official-height-1955-to-2020-2026-s1.webp 640w, https://travelhimalayanepal.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=1080,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-official-height-1955-to-2020-2026-s1.webp 1080w, https://travelhimalayanepal.com/"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cdn-cgi/image/width=1600,quality=68,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://media.travelhimalayanepal.com/news/everest-official-height-1955-to-2020-2026-s1.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 760px\" data-full=\"https://pub-2153aa6d32ca4a5da7850eaa8e290576.r2.dev/news/everest-official-height-1955-to-2020-2026-s1.webp\" alt=\"A surveyor sighting through an instrument\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eTwo surveys, two answers.\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHow the 2020 number was measured\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNepal ended its dependence on foreign survey data in 2017, training its own geodetic team to carry GPS receivers and gravity meters to the summit alongside oxygen bottles and rope. A Nepali team completed the climb and survey in May 2019; a Chinese team followed in May 2020, delayed a year by the pandemic. The two governments then reconciled both data sets and, instead of each publishing a separate number again, announced one figure together for the first time in the mountain's surveying history.\u003c/p\u003e4f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"nv-body\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"div\",\"h0\",{\"className\":\"rich-part\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eEverest is 8,848.86 metres above sea level. That figure only became official on 8 December 2020, when the foreign ministers of Nepal and China pressed a button at the same moment during a livestreamed ceremony and revealed a number neither country had published before. For 65 years, the world had been climbing, filming and writing about a mountain whose exact height nobody could actually agree on.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L77\",\"m1\",{}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"h2\",{\"className\":\"rich-part\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$78\"}}],\"$L79\",\"$L7a\"],false]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pad\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"children\":\"Annapurna Base Camp Trek — 7 Days\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$$\",800,\" pp\"]}]]}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"$L12\",\"a-13-days-annapurna-circuit-trek-starts-from-kathmandu,a-13-days-annapurna-circuit-trek-starts-from-kathmandu\",{\"href\":\"https://travelhimalayanepal.com/tours/13-days-annapurna-circuit-trek-starts-from-kathmandu\",\"className\":\"nv-tk\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"img\",\"style\":{\"position\":\"relative\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"src\":\"https://pub-2153aa6d32ca4a5da7850eaa8e290576.r2.dev/tours/13-days-annapurna-circuit-trek-starts-from-kathmandu/featured.webp\",\"alt\":\"Annapurna Circuit Trek — 13 Days\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"230px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"style\":{\"objectFit\":\"cover\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pad\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"child